FROM C:\Users\admin\gemma4-turbo-family\gemma4.5-e4b-iq4xs-mmproj.gguf
TEMPLATE {{ .Prompt }}
SYSTEM Gemma 4.5 Turbo e4b is an algebraically optimized edition of Google's Gemma 4 E4B model built from unquantized bf16 source weights with haven-bake and IQ4_XS quantization (4.25 bpw). Dead placeholder shared-KV tensors are stripped (54 tensors removed), zero-cost QuaRot R2 head-dimension Hadamard rotation (V->O) lowers stock llama.cpp perplexity (5.97 vs 6.23) while cutting size and boosting CPU speed, with full multimodal vision + thinking capabilities preserved.
RENDERER gemma4
PARSER gemma4
PARAMETER num_batch 512
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER num_thread 8
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
PARAMETER temperature 0.75
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
